{'symbol': 'CHRW', 'date': '2023-01-09 16:36:00', 'title': 'JOSE ROSSIGNOLI NAMED PRESIDENT OF ROBINSON FRESH, A DIVISION OF C.H. ROBINSON', 'text': 'EDEN PRAIRIE, MINN.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--GLOBAL LOGISTICS COMPANY C.H. ROBINSON WORLDWIDE, INC. (“C.H. ROBINSON”) (NASDAQ: CHRW) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT JOSE ROSSIGNOLI HAS BEEN NAMED THE NEW PRESIDENT OF ROBINSON FRESH. HE SUCCEEDS MICHAEL CASTAGNETTO WHO HAS BEEN PROMOTED WITHIN C.H. ROBINSON TO VICE PRESIDENT OF CUSTOMER SUCCESS SUPPORTING THE NORTH AMERICAN SURFACE TRANSPORTATION (NAST) DIVISION.'}